### 1. Создать endpoint
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "GitHub test"
}

###

### 2. Получить endpoint по id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/endpoints/01a09673-fd2b-7a54-a323-14ac44278f63

###

### 3. Отправить простой webhook
POST http://localhost:8080/h/01a09673-fd2b-7a54-a323-14ac44278f63
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "test",
  "message": "Hello Webhook Forge"
}

###

### 4. Тест webhook оплаты
POST http://localhost:8080/h/01a09673-fd2b-7a54-a323-14ac44278f63
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "payment.completed",
  "paymentId": 8421,
  "amount": 1499.99,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "customerId": 52
}

###

### 5. Тест webhook, похожего на GitHub
POST http://localhost:8080/h/01a09673-fd2b-7a54-a323-14ac44278f63
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: push
X-GitHub-Delivery: test-delivery-123

{
  "ref": "refs/heads/main",
  "repository": {
    "name": "webhook-forge",
    "fullName": "Netusq/webhook-forge"
  },
  "sender": {
    "login": "Netusq"
  },
  "commits": [
    {
      "id": "abc123",
      "message": "Add webhook receiver"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 6. Endpoint не существует
POST http://localhost:8080/h/01900000-0000-7000-8000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "should-fail"
}

###

### 7. Невалидный UUID
POST http://localhost:8080/h/not-a-uuid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "invalid-token"
}